[
  {"id": 0, "src_sha256": "8fec6eba0f764b91b66217699269e91a0bf6c99b63a8b76bee1c2df015bed2f7", "zh": "沒問題。我隨時準備好了……不管是什麼，我都奉陪！ "},
  {"id": 1, "src_sha256": "02282b00b16717dd3ec06cbeebcdf3eea4350611c391ab2ba60365aa06a159a6", "zh": "我就知道我越來越厲害了！ "},
  {"id": 2, "src_sha256": "f4d853d2b2db7173e217b1c0d3283a836637acce8d7e8cf19e0ea6b7998e353b", "zh": "我身上這些窟窿可一點忙都幫不上！ "},
  {"id": 3, "src_sha256": "5e27abfcca2ef985f34030e35d8f9f17127c20352626702200c44582d1c26cc5", "zh": "我受傷了，該死！拜託……幫幫我。 "},
  {"id": 4, "src_sha256": "bd6c8af3454a95b235e5a154b1e9aa88323e0eab130973a2e069113303b7e77f", "zh": "我站著都要睡著了。 "},
  {"id": 5, "src_sha256": "84208ab25178d723d3df2c91583032f11f63f1e43cc7166c3c8aa3ecea49976c", "zh": "我染上什麼討厭的病了。 "},
  {"id": 6, "src_sha256": "9837348fdf420a09bd471fb3ba1250379e3a3b5f937224f1ec8fd7f04a9e761e", "zh": "我覺得不對勁。 "},
  {"id": 7, "src_sha256": "76922b1e2dba31c2bd46a443082d2c76d141e2a859a77655a8800450dc611e5a", "zh": "我瞎了！ "},
  {"id": 8, "src_sha256": "b26865d173b5cf5c922972f277359bc232aa0a2c8ca24ccef96b1ae6cf9c1951", "zh": "我看起來像大力士嗎？這些我扛不動。 "},
  {"id": 9, "src_sha256": "971e76e67a44acce9f8841e9e069fba9e937d827b99c2b53e518e99b6823ec3b", "zh": "嘿！我動不了。 "},
  {"id": 10, "src_sha256": "ce4722789718d696eedf2c5977e5ba2063ddd4968dfdd4dedce68e77dcae2ee1", "zh": "我附議！ "},
  {"id": 11, "src_sha256": "b59497d8027f3e97694c7f0625f2bcbfecf466df387167254a06e4e37c1915b1", "zh": "是啊，我夠強，撐得住。不像某些人。 "},
  {"id": 12, "src_sha256": "c40bcc5173b1161c99ed6620b5671de5157f2e85b14291deb26b5fcab800ca98", "zh": "死亡也沒傳說中那麼了不起。 "},
  {"id": 13, "src_sha256": "cbdd9fb56fec8500af5b5a3301b819c047f7061d200d589c13fdc976759fe7b2", "zh": "該死！我們到底要怎麼辦？這下真的糟了！ "},
  {"id": 14, "src_sha256": "94816b67b63976f3f7edcbf80ede18fb13212e8c41e40747b7aad13721ab5f63", "zh": "拜託！我最討厭這樣乾站著！去殺點什麼吧。 "},
  {"id": 15, "src_sha256": "cba67279bd483de71d0533f3871602eaa16401d781d15be220dde4082532ef94", "zh": "你在幹嘛？噁心死了！ "},
  {"id": 16, "src_sha256": "5756cec1367b4424616b39b6ff4ad27a3586c5651da816849aa334ee0cc2f0df", "zh": "該死！抱歉啦。 "},
  {"id": 17, "src_sha256": "c61de4370d949ced8a40ccc517f70fb15573a79f0cbc235c8f452e44f4a0c901", "zh": "看清楚你在幹嘛！外行人。 "},
  {"id": 18, "src_sha256": "e68e849bd2d7fc05c32dfb7086e3b539057edf5cc06b29b40cd8b64a14494eb0", "zh": "喔，該死！起來啊，老兄！ "},
  {"id": 19, "src_sha256": "8b494fb07b937134e7202d3d07ce52a067dc9e1117faf0dacf3c60305f30d5c4", "zh": "喂，拜託！姑娘，別死啊！ "},
  {"id": 20, "src_sha256": "abda4409daec5ded0b6bd80909e92ca143acdf6f1c6004cf02f6de503e1c1a12", "zh": "該死，連這麼簡單的小戰鬥都沒辦法讓他們活著嗎？ "},
  {"id": 21, "src_sha256": "aeded9e2cf93996bf70b06ce7f4309347b125787ddb2c96ae4cafcb0e13bbc09", "zh": "好了——別再胡鬧了！ "},
  {"id": 22, "src_sha256": "9679312ce5b15975a3aad88d4cc959b7342dbc88bb1909484daae23b99e0b681", "zh": "該死！沒人說過這是自殺任務啊！ "},
  {"id": 23, "src_sha256": "8c0cfe1b4aefc827697bbfd7c6bd423a332b3ca2850ff5b1ff4b4b8ba9aef4ab", "zh": "嘿，我發現東西了…… "},
  {"id": 24, "src_sha256": "92ef80e46f83188058693ad9e2290ac3e000a95c037cf2c6d1c2f03121c7ef22", "zh": "那邊那是什麼？ "},
  {"id": 25, "src_sha256": "f391b0e11df86163fc3541493292a63a8176b40dc6784bcdfa206a2c46380309", "zh": "這東西有陷阱，而且很大。 "},
  {"id": 26, "src_sha256": "9034da20ba9a5956e309c81bc0a33ae82284d9fc8b08404f924f0c411b9a210f", "zh": "哼。這裡藏了東西。 "},
  {"id": 27, "src_sha256": "e7ba859a48112902d5729da55dcee6a01deb9880f8fa30ffe8b1c1712420f32c", "zh": "這裡有名堂。跟著我。 "},
  {"id": 28, "src_sha256": "f92eb63d7894b4dea8c6544cd568d8da8b65b247125fc14442228f9aac8c5448", "zh": "噢。我身上的洞比針插還多！ "},
  {"id": 29, "src_sha256": "0786513310a77a9b74ffcd8d31f7bfc2d4c6d8e163495a6062b1333f37041495", "zh": "過來讓媽咪疼疼！該開打了。 "},
  {"id": 30, "src_sha256": "41e8fb16e25f5022d5137140246dfc34bec2796a7e59bf144b29753ef8374fad", "zh": "排好隊，我來一個個砍倒！ "},
  {"id": 31, "src_sha256": "3f5df106f49536f2f6b06cea40c043735b41124e110596c55cd50ac989935d9f", "zh": "見鬼了！該打了！ "},
  {"id": 32, "src_sha256": "61db97326127e1091514ac5b27649ac611f883ff0eaae51aab22f65fdae4d79a", "zh": "下一個倒楣鬼是誰？ "},
  {"id": 33, "src_sha256": "2384c86ec3151b45292707be8696a7db87ad22daf9be0f1fc0141679d77b5745", "zh": "這些東西沒完沒了！！ "},
  {"id": 34, "src_sha256": "7bcef6f96fff50051d7889d5d2252a690c804f0b09f3294075ff9bbbd916721e", "zh": "差一點，可惜還差一點！ "},
  {"id": 35, "src_sha256": "db359f4f696236a00d96257792dc26c4cd73c9be10b899ff305d2557e3b8f0bb", "zh": "喔耶！ "},
  {"id": 36, "src_sha256": "e2012e359f98a19bbbfe78a46ea2b8a1e7c30226f0d4b395eeb0c01b8bfbb20a", "zh": "我只有一句話要說。你就去地獄爛掉吧，Savant。 "},
  {"id": 37, "src_sha256": "dd6d69ea1e261a4be4dc9202a04ecf53a696583f4867b0a4024e09a6e311a1e5", "zh": "沒人能惹我，永遠沒有！ "},
  {"id": 38, "src_sha256": "40e50ea20564e8f2889b480cbc36e07c61ff1f9a2e4e9b32187ef30fbe6d7b74", "zh": "嘿，那是誰？ "},
  {"id": 39, "src_sha256": "af2bb0683870d05303a84af7f8cddfa708e799a25d00444ce52247e1f381fe59", "zh": "嘿，我需要彈藥！ "},
  {"id": 40, "src_sha256": "b9c1741c28ffd186173ac1eb9cb29da2eaa399e70dd84453965c88614654d18f", "zh": "有人不見了，該死！ "},
  {"id": 41, "src_sha256": "9ba1fb9f5140b6216d85282657d2eee2473fd442c40ffc8f3291615e4ad20a14", "zh": "來啊！還等什麼？Dark Savant 就在裡面，等著讓我們宰了他！ "},
  {"id": 42, "src_sha256": "0154ca72508e65d7cd60660069b99dd54614f3c02d4df642886fa6391ee7fead", "zh": "我，Cosmic Lord？喔耶！來吧，開始吧。我們有一大堆東西要寫呢！ "},
  {"id": 43, "src_sha256": "6767eb0adebd347b5e3f7a5682513d96707c976c259a586569b1121c15c94dfc", "zh": "算了吧。這活兒得找男人。有些事他們還是有點用處的。嘿。 "},
  {"id": 46, "src_sha256": "cac9af9d58a0081576733222bf8f2b1620e40123be845b315107a29a2c6a83c5", "zh": "生命的秘密，是吧？依我看，活著就是生命！現在把這塊玻璃疙瘩弄出去。 "},
  {"id": 47, "src_sha256": "58410bf4c0f8f4609b50294c500f5061c129641e57ba6d6dfb892c95b2833eec", "zh": "讓我確認一下。Marten 看了這東西就瘋了？他本來腦袋就不太正常吧。 "},
  {"id": 48, "src_sha256": "4c7716af30772a6d7f5594340e962bdc950c27bc701f37b57c54bc1f6cbbdd0d", "zh": "拿到了。現在離開這裡。雖然我愛打架，但對 {{Mook}} 我們還是別冒險。 "},
  {"id": 49, "src_sha256": "4e615756e460993a11e08f57bff8dfbccde9621eca6fba6a37ed2f68e8864eab", "zh": "Chaos 的威能，是吧？你知道嗎，連我都覺得這東西太危險，不能留太久。 "},
  {"id": 50, "src_sha256": "ef065afc5e9c2b34feefa80fbc24ee9308673009f2eb1842977f023d70e79a32", "zh": "你知道嗎，我真想聽一次好消息！ "},
  {"id": 51, "src_sha256": "3c61dfae0afd3cfa55b977fd14ef55696a73d7eb202325d7ed0587a0616cd275", "zh": "各位？我得走了。喔，拜託！別一臉驚訝。我是 {{Mook}}，他們也是 {{Mook}}。這是家族的事，好嗎？我很快就跟上你們。 "},
  {"id": 52, "src_sha256": "147cb884d27f41cd08fa72b43f2d46ac6fcbf8ee2d0b48ab6e109a18426e447f", "zh": "我這趟沒白跑……{{Mook}} 在裡面有東西。非常重要的東西！他們像展示戰利品一樣把它擺出來。 "},
  {"id": 53, "src_sha256": "8c986c500b0ad61d4d60730c083a7a7aed4e4d82ab5b6504a2b492ec7886749e", "zh": "你瘋了嗎？ "},
  {"id": 54, "src_sha256": "62d40d8defceeeb1f75f41f2a7ab1b605fe2da893a681881bdf265cac6d04669", "zh": "謊話，謊話，全是謊話。 "},
  {"id": 55, "src_sha256": "64d4cae4136b56e73a5e467f830935240493cadfb25c9aaf604b50100721ab0d", "zh": "讚啦！ "},
  {"id": 56, "src_sha256": "31c0fc544fa570e7b050cb364dfc5c75a7936061d4a8b7fe4d605bf7da57de91", "zh": "美貌加才華……這可是致命的組合。 "},
  {"id": 57, "src_sha256": "75cc81e0a9ac768e257977daaaae4c79583b36b8f1e180a8fd433186cd3615fd", "zh": "喔，又是她。 "},
  {"id": 58, "src_sha256": "c496852cd2647c6ab4e0649b3762ba37ba3cfe8dede0be68fe46e1d68b200a74", "zh": "總算逃出那團亂了。 "},
  {"id": 59, "src_sha256": "bc50ef3546a54224a6422b2dd48ef56de5f96c5a6d4d02ad3122c3bdcb41bd13", "zh": "你是說那些瘋子跟 Dark Savant 聯手了？這下麻煩了。我們唯一的希望就是在他們殺我們之前先殺了他們。 "},
  {"id": 60, "src_sha256": "78058c7b2a7329285767b67bd7afd9347c696a0782c58ad2e31768487a7e198e", "zh": "那就是 Dark Savant？我真想用劍把他那顆亮晶晶的小圓頂敲開。 "},
  {"id": 61, "src_sha256": "78035743265ab744f095f42d1ba719d83809cd909bba23f1485808e7d2ed9a4c", "zh": "這顆瘋狂星球上我見過的怪事裡，那傢伙最離譜。不過他似乎很懂這個 Forge 的事。我覺得值得調查一下。 "},
  {"id": 62, "src_sha256": "93cc17be656da3dbc406a12078a4efd603fe92ab6e4473e4923e04a877dc0830", "zh": "好準的一槍！這是 Savant 給我們惹的麻煩的報應。你覺得 Savant 在船上嗎？ "},
  {"id": 63, "src_sha256": "d6ab5d651fe599c3c92cb5f3f0650559b8e57fb65a1cee02d5b9ca0e1b7d7670", "zh": "終於！看到 T'Rang 和 Umpani 和解真好。他們的世仇已經打了不知多久。啊，我想打得挺有趣的，可惜結束了。 "},
  {"id": 64, "src_sha256": "8175e3218999abd9a376b5e4dee4481ac7191a58d0f96ca0960405860620ffe1", "zh": "該死！看來有人想阻止我們到達 Cosmic Circle。我敢說我知道那個人是誰！ "},
  {"id": 65, "src_sha256": "6289a027da720f0933574950b7831adaa41e867ac3b3fa4391b9629f245c0fc2", "zh": "好耶！任務完成。走吧！ "},
  {"id": 66, "src_sha256": "8dfa0fb33aab51072b72724fdb199bc333211b49ad5795a12c34b05ac20f7569", "zh": "他為什麼把這東西扔在地上？我猜它大概沒有傳說中那麼了不起。 "},
  {"id": 67, "src_sha256": "5f668c8360add22e477a6760ab1950968e993ad56b8cf5295d38322f79164d51", "zh": "發現鮮肉！ "},
  {"id": 68, "src_sha256": "b36d437122fc2387b537149fd77614cdc3e6d533a4ae3f661ccb2a1bf0981797", "zh": "這邊有野生動物…… "},
  {"id": 84, "src_sha256": "cc09c46d125d6bd66c8fe0f113db97f5b1711d3337f857b642d369e7b710db9f", "zh": "這才像話。 "},
  {"id": 85, "src_sha256": "509c042eca417031a723f83ec27385d9d0fd378d92f8d726e11210818aa19d64", "zh": "喔耶，真是鬆了口氣。 "},
  {"id": 121, "src_sha256": "52b69c94eb95b704bb07e28b4ccbc63b31fda548807bfc4b92a32de9f8715812", "zh": "你知道嗎，就一個黏糊糊的昆蟲人來說，他還不賴。 "},
  {"id": 125, "src_sha256": "c5eea29fb59635138dfff47a4626d278516b1949367d32558d0153f8748e396e", "zh": "可愛的小傢伙。不過太容易激動了。 "},
  {"id": 128, "src_sha256": "518125691a7ee0e868a56a2f72e4a54fe0ef76345b3184e97a2c6b9ba21dfea0", "zh": "你知道嗎，就一隻會走路的大毛球來說，他還挺嚴肅的。 "},
  {"id": 129, "src_sha256": "c0b8fe49ef04bc5dca709eadbda9bc40afd56acdc03228c2c379f064655cee25", "zh": "啊，我碰過比這更糟的情況。我相信我們能脫身。來吧，上路了。 "},
  {"id": 130, "src_sha256": "f32185a74418778469b6f844b36ca70757f98b0127172c5cd1e8663f4b8f0393", "zh": "不知道這玩意兒是什麼？ "},
  {"id": 132, "src_sha256": "2488b77846540521677556355ba764d5883985155d5094a2dba293b0fa0f70dc", "zh": "啊，Helm of Serenity。嘿，也許它能治好我的偏頭痛！ "},
  {"id": 134, "src_sha256": "03753208eac46e93c8f4e06a2a1822d428ba656e4d36e9cf1c40df13ae25a7f2", "zh": "你們看那座塔！一定是 Savant 的老窩。 "},
  {"id": 137, "src_sha256": "8bccbd2f91bc34c61b09d7cbe0e5749d6b30eb23f7584c9eb2a6a1afcc7c0580", "zh": "嘿，一間房子！也許我們可以進去躲躲這該死的濕氣。 "},
  {"id": 140, "src_sha256": "080441b496b8bd9cc998ba6c2a8cbfc885bf0355dee17b447f739341e4ae9b1f", "zh": "看那個玩意兒。它吐 T'Rang 吐得像明天就要世界末日一樣。 "},
  {"id": 145, "src_sha256": "2f9f7ed54a5d453e908ac369b8e2eb7aed1df790b7a914a7b74d4c39ab0fd74f", "zh": "哈！想像一下我們跟 Rapax 組隊！這太好笑了。 "}
]
